<input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
<input type="hidden" name="_url" value="https://jasonknashville.com/guides/nashville-builder-mortgage-rate-incentives-october-2026/" />
<input type="text" name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" class="trap" aria-hidden="true" />
<label for="buyer-name">Name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="buyer-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120" placeholder="Your name" />
<label for="buyer-email">Email <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="buyer-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180" placeholder="you@example.com" />
<label for="buyer-area">Preferred area(s) <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="buyer-area" name="Preferred areas" type="text" required maxlength="240" placeholder="e.g., Mount Juliet, Lebanon, Smyrna" />
<label for="buyer-budget">Approximate budget <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><select id="buyer-budget" name="Approximate budget" required><option value="" disabled selected>Select a price range</option><option>Under $350,000</option><option>$350,000–$450,000</option><option>$450,000–$600,000</option><option>$600,000–$750,000</option><option>$750,000+</option><option>Flexible / unsure</option></select>
<label for="buyer-phone">Phone <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label><input id="buyer-phone" name="Phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="35" placeholder="(615) 555-1234" />
<button type="submit" class="button light">Send me the list →</button>
<small>I'll use your details to respond to this request. Submissions are delivered through FormSubmit, a third-party form service. No account needed.</small>
</form></section>
<p>Whether you're looking in Mount Juliet, Lebanon, Old Hickory, Hermitage, Antioch, Smyrna, Murfreesboro or elsewhere around Nashville, the goal is to find the home and financing arrangement that make sense for you.</p>
<p><small>Rates and promotions can change at any time. Availability, eligible homes, loan programs, credit qualifications, preferred lender rules, contract deadlines and other conditions apply. Confirm terms in writing with the builder and lender. This article is educational and not an offer of credit.</small></p>
</div></article>
